# P4 package index source (single source of truth for packaged CE apps).
#
# Columns, pipe-separated:  name|version|description|file|cmd
#   name   : package key used by `pkg install/remove/info`
#   version: free-form version string
#   desc   : one-line description (no '|' inside)
#   file   : .catpkg payload in /pkg/ on the guest volume
#   cmd    : installed command -> /bin/<cmd>.ce
#
# These apps live in extapp/ but are deliberately NOT in build/apps.list:
# builtins go straight to /bin, packages only reach /bin after `pkg install`.
bc|1.0|tiny integer calculator (A op B)|bc.catpkg|bc
stats|1.0|lines/words/bytes text statistics|stats.catpkg|stats
rps|1.0|rock-paper-scissors one round vs cpu|rps.catpkg|rps
# legacy reference only, not shipped: extapp/desktop.c 保留作学习参考，
# 不再打包进镜像；块化桌面由 kernel_v25 内核态 gui/ 子系统承担。
